{"game": "alien-swarm", "language": "english", "appid": 630, "month": "2017-01", "window": 2, "start_date": 1483833600, "end_date": 1484524799, "month_true_total": 88, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-06 01:01:23 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "29284305", "author": {"steamid": "76561198020648141", "personaname": "Maj", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Hypermajava/", "num_games_owned": 484, "num_reviews": 37, "playtime_forever": 1054, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1054, "last_played": 1473201436, "avatar": "5b8825b34c5d77b00c3a18897f2f1175fa0e0e57"}, "language": "english", "review": "this game is ♥♥♥♥♥♥♥ ebin", "timestamp_created": 1484517700, "timestamp_updated": 1484517700, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.476190477609634399", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1279569600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "29282967", "author": {"steamid": "76561198080036714", "personaname": "Koderious", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Koderious/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 41, "playtime_forever": 1186, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1164, "last_played": 1488237005, "avatar": "18cf9e93edbe79213f24fd277a0c8fc05e9ec68f"}, "language": "english", "review": "First off...go to Moddb and DL reactive drop 1.20. http://www.moddb.com/mods/reactivedrop\n\nThis is the only review I have ever done, and the reason is this game is so awesome and more people need to play it. There are so many sweet mods you can download to enhance your experience. I would easily pay money for this and the fact that it is free is just amazing. It is not internet or resource intensive at all, there are fan made dedicated servers  (which are more populated than the games basic online lobby) some of which also have websites that have the map mods to download for that specific server. \n\nThere is a fan made dedicated sequel called Reactive drop coming out soon which will add more \"official\" content as well. I am jumping between multiple games atm, and out of all of them, this free game is the one i have the best time on, it is intense simple addictive action. Its not just a twinstick shooter where you just effortlessly blast things to bits...with friendly fire and limitited ammo/supplies, you have to really pay attention. \n\nI dont have dedicated RL friends that play this game and im having an awesome time with the random ppl im grouping up with. If you can make your own squad of 4 people with voice comm, the fun factor would be ridic. \n\nIt's free and a small download...just do it :)", "timestamp_created": 1484513238, "timestamp_updated": 1484658017, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1279569600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "29282948", "author": {"steamid": "76561198128879898", "personaname": "Larry David", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/n0thingface/", "num_games_owned": 887, "num_reviews": 292, "playtime_forever": 593, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 231, "last_played": 1635529167, "avatar": "8ae104e99fc6a2aeb4b560bad7d8d2e275848b4d"}, "language": "english", "review": "Why is this game still on steam? Alien Swarm Reactive Drop is this game + more content, so please Gaben remove this from the site. It shouldn't be here. Like Australia.", "timestamp_created": 1484513176, "timestamp_updated": 1633029420, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.472353816032409668", "comment_count": 0, "steam_